<%# Org switcher dot: unread notifications in one of the user's OTHER
    organisations (Notifications::UnreadSignals). The root carries the id, so the
    replace in _other_orgs_signal_streams swaps exactly this node; with nothing to
    show it stays in the DOM, hidden, as the next target. %>
<%= render Neo::UnreadMarkerComponent.new(count: counts.values.sum, variant: :dot, live: true,
                                          id: 'other_orgs_signal',
                                          label: t('navigation.other_orgs_signal')) %>
